  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteSheet
  title: ADMISSION FORM, NO. 0013
  content: '<b>GENERAL HOSPITAL, WARD C</b>


    <b>LAST NAME:</b> LAMBERT

    <b>FIRST NAME:</b> Billy

    <b>DATE OF BIRTH:</b> November 13, 1946 (age 26)

    <b>SEX:</b> M

    <b>BLOOD TYPE:</b> O negative

    <b>HEIGHT / WEIGHT:</b> 5 ft 10 in / 157 lb

    <b>OCCUPATION:</b> Statistician (insurance)

    <b>ROOM:</b> 13


    <b>ADMITTED:</b> September 23, 1973, voluntary


    <b>REASON FOR ADMISSION</b>

    The patient hears a voice that repeats "thirteen" at regular intervals. He describes it as "neutral, patient, without malice." No other symptoms. No known psychiatric history.


    <b>DIAGNOSIS</b>

    Schizophrenia (to be confirmed)


    <b>TREATMENT</b>

    Antipsychotics. Continuous observation.'
  reaction:
    text: "<i>Thirteen\u2026 Was I really hearing that voice? </i>"
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  reactionPlayed: 0
